# A rebind rebuild reads the source through the decoding client path, so it
# projects every value upcast to the target (the #5225 unaliased rebuild).
MODULE: QuiescentAtStampedVersionRebuildUpcasts
TARGET: QuiescentAtStampedVersion
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the rebind rebuild projects decoded, upcast bodies
PERTURBS: Rebind

--- FIND
    /\ ~Live
    /\ Rebuild(Scan(phys))
--- REPLACE
    /\ ~Live
    /\ Rebuild([k \in Keys |-> Proj(defn, Decode(stored[phys][k]))])
--- END
